    "updated_at": "2016-09-25T03:27:47Z",
    "body": "I doc'd DOMStringList in IDB just to have something describing what implementations currently have, since we're apparently not rushing towards `FrozenArrayWithContains<DOMString>` as quickly as we'd like.\n\nPer https://github.com/w3c/IndexedDB/issues/85 and F2F discussions, there's desire to make DOMStringList `iterable<DOMString>`, which should still be web-compatible with removing it.\n",
